      "source_sha256": "d4458114ba5675b035a67d29e01ed4dabddcec60c90a21ac4818b3537d9df69f",
      "target": "# 频谱图、mel 尺度与音频特征\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0002",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features"
      ],
      "ordinal": 1,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0003",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "eb43b2293a9afe031bf6ac4a031c9b6d275eb1a2599dc9466bf97108d12f3fac",
      "target": "> 神经网络不擅长直接处理原始波形，却能处理频谱图（spectrogram），而基于梅尔频率尺度（mel）的频谱图效果更好。2026 年的每个自动语音识别（ASR）、文本转语音（TTS）系统和音频分类器，都成败系于这一个预处理选择。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0004",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "2842977a83ddfbb35dddb890a247e6d13e7f0983ecdf35573df0b7b8b2afddc4",
      "target": "**Type:** Build\n**Languages:** Python\n**Prerequisites:** 阶段 6 · 01（音频基础）\n**Time:** ~45 分钟\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0006",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "f88026ff32dd8f43def76262b9b1e99e1082ea528c571c9922238a9fa88f4fe5",
      "target": "## 要解决的问题\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0008",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "a6af7ef8de4ab8f273642ea275ceeabaa9c07b8be3d1160ba800a3623adabd02",
      "target": "以一段时长 10 秒、采样率为 16 kHz 的音频为例，它包含 160,000 个浮点数，都位于 `[-1, 1]` 范围内，与“狗叫”或“单词 cat”这样的标签几乎完全不相关。原始波形包含信息，但其形式让模型难以提取。相隔 100 ms 发出的两个相同音素，会有完全不同的原始采样点。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0010",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "ede06dd2f014741e1b264a0c27dabd9bce95728294a575d1764521885009218d",
      "target": "频谱图解决了这个问题。它压缩人类感知忽略的时间细节（微秒级抖动），并保留人类感知关注的结构（在 ~10–25 ms 的时间窗口内，哪些频率具有较高能量）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0012",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "9a35eb57c4a2e423717b2ccdca4eeb459783f3b360d8da2ea23e10a50d408c3f",
      "target": "mel 频谱图更进一步。人类对音高的感知呈对数关系：100 Hz 与 200 Hz 听起来的“间距”，和 1000 Hz 与 2000 Hz 的“间距”相同。mel 尺度通过变换频率轴来匹配这种感知。采用 mel 尺度的频谱图，是从 2010 到 2026 年语音机器学习中最重要的单一特征。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0014",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "c7b44801605d0b8c776d3915355cff883fdbf9e3ecb29219ac88ef4edd08ab1b",
      "target": "## 核心概念\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0016",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "bc51f6dccd4b6703c3be404dd2a755329e04e16e482dccbde5a31076c1b7ee47",
      "target": "![从波形到 STFT、mel 频谱图再到 MFCC 的逐级转换](../assets/mel-features.svg)\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0018",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "d6559db01a01a6f98fc36a41593e7d8f12624cd3ba3d1db6a7129a32a7041206",
      "target": "**短时傅里叶变换（STFT）。** 将波形切分为相互重叠的帧（典型设置：25 ms 窗长、10 ms 帧移 = 在 16 kHz 下分别为 400 个采样点 / 160 个采样点）。每一帧都乘以窗函数（默认使用 Hann；Hamming 的取舍略有不同）。对每帧进行快速傅里叶变换（FFT）。将幅度谱堆叠成形状为 `(n_frames, n_freq_bins)` 的矩阵，这就是频谱图。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0020",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "6c740d817d2531e2a042c592e017d6c7ab4abfa079c8c5cc143f01ce6684128f",
      "target": "**对数幅度。** 原始幅度跨越 5-6 个数量级。取 `log(|X| + 1e-6)` 或 `20 * log10(|X|)` 来压缩动态范围。所有生产流水线都使用对数幅度，而非原始幅度。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0022",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "c6bd4685d7aef76496cfe04f18fdb86f9decae10767d3918e078d55494fa9faf",
      "target": "**mel 尺度。** 单位为 Hz 的频率 `f` 可映射为 mel 值 `m`，公式为 `m = 2595 * log10(1 + f / 700)`。这一映射在 1 kHz 以下近似线性，在更高频率处近似对数。覆盖 0–8 kHz 的 80 个 mel 频带是标准的 ASR 输入。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0024",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "436840debe2401e129b5b543cfc22a0ab225584aa0295e2093e507e98392d5d9",
      "target": "**mel 滤波器组。** 一组在 mel 尺度上等间距分布的三角滤波器。每个滤波器对相邻的 FFT 频点进行加权求和。将 STFT 幅度与滤波器组矩阵相乘，一次矩阵乘法就能得到 mel 频谱图。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0026",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "d9b22cb1b314661ad58255b7bcca0997e83ad954e3addb404637fb04e951a6e8",
      "target": "**log-mel 频谱图。** `log(mel_spec + 1e-10)`。Whisper 的输入，Parakeet 的输入，SeamlessM4T 的输入，也是 2026 年通用的音频前端。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0028",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "cec8ca173336f955b1f37e60fea5edd0682a0d22e640665ddb799b21cafb3311",
      "target": "**MFCC（梅尔频率倒谱系数）。** 对 log-mel 频谱图应用离散余弦变换（DCT，II 型），保留前 13 个系数。这会降低特征间的相关性，并进一步压缩表示。它一直是主流特征，直到大约 2015 年，直接处理 log-mel 的卷积神经网络（CNN）和 Transformer 赶了上来。它仍用于说话人识别（x-vectors、ECAPA）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0030",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "36ffa1808b5272a2fed76050a6c504a528b6e596408d369eb5001f9cbae23222",
      "target": "**分辨率取舍。** 更大的 FFT = 更好的频率分辨率，但更差的时间分辨率。25 ms / 10 ms 是音频机器学习的默认设置；音乐使用 50 ms / 12.5 ms；瞬态检测（鼓点、爆破音）使用 5 ms / 2 ms。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0032",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0033",
