    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 1: frame the waveform"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "419577ceea8f48aed8577f35d8f2844a902ef00c23585bc1df66dbe3fc1b7fe3",
      "target": "### 步骤 1：对波形分帧\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0038",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 1: frame the waveform"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0039",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 1: frame the waveform"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "ca1aebe45e8cb52fb9313e8e4318f6d0ad819b69d3a488cb88be10b42111298b",
      "target": "```python\ndef frame(signal, frame_len, hop):\n    n = 1 + (len(signal) - frame_len) // hop\n    return [signal[i * hop : i * hop + frame_len] for i in range(n)]\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0040",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 1: frame the waveform"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 1: frame the waveform"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "f05934f75b513104c25866b1414774f253f2a12f27a8009da2decc6f93828916",
      "target": "一段时长 10 秒、采样率为 16 kHz 的音频，在 `frame_len=400, hop=160` 时会得到 998 帧。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0042",
      "kind": "separator",
