        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Hann window"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "60390d00fa78145608b8c245fdd334dcf742ce428bd81266a68ea2a9d133cef9",
      "target": "### 步骤 2：Hann 窗\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0044",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Hann window"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0045",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Hann window"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "5539d11d65e9a1cff6a3b6fd466d3913d67a80dc5ec09b0adfa076a08a4ab471",
      "target": "```python\nimport math\n\ndef hann(N):\n    return [0.5 * (1 - math.cos(2 * math.pi * n / (N - 1))) for n in range(N)]\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0046",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Hann window"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Hann window"
      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
      "source_sha256": "1473bf55d72c76768990d7881894795dc0888b8da365f5671eb80a596d72394f",
      "target": "在 FFT 之前逐元素相乘。这样可以消除在非零端点处截断所导致的频谱泄漏。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0048",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Hann window"
      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: STFT magnitude"
      ],
      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "4fb8c5efee893c6eb62e55468a98f80b5396691c0aa2fd257a4ad521f5492952",
      "target": "### 步骤 3：STFT 幅度\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0050",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: STFT magnitude"
      ],
      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0051",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: STFT magnitude"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "48b8bb5d8b0285e388132514fc8f15d8218d7efb63cedcd189d3210e165da85d",
      "target": "```python\ndef stft_magnitude(signal, frame_len=400, hop=160):\n    win = hann(frame_len)\n    frames = frame(signal, frame_len, hop)\n    return [magnitudes(dft([w * s for w, s in zip(win, f)])) for f in frames]\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0052",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: STFT magnitude"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: STFT magnitude"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "8cb8815a71aed222f85fcd76e1b014a43a62aebc68e3c1c12cc6d284846e7d11",
      "target": "生产环境使用 `torch.stft` 或 `librosa.stft`（基于 FFT，采用向量化实现）。这里的循环用于教学，会在 `code/main.py` 中对短音频片段运行。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0054",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: STFT magnitude"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: mel filterbank"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "cf6f288f479e770143ee769ff4e46e8bd2f3c8b66a8d1ef6a6e84ddd752bb12f",
      "target": "### 步骤 4：mel 滤波器组\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0056",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: mel filterbank"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0057",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: mel filterbank"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "348781ad2ba97002bf26ae83f070ffd4e497f0066817e140fb1c97fb99b6177d",
      "target": "```python\ndef hz_to_mel(f):\n    return 2595.0 * math.log10(1.0 + f / 700.0)\n\ndef mel_to_hz(m):\n    return 700.0 * (10 ** (m / 2595.0) - 1)\n\ndef mel_filterbank(n_mels, n_fft, sr, fmin=0, fmax=None):\n    fmax = fmax or sr / 2\n    mels = [hz_to_mel(fmin) + (hz_to_mel(fmax) - hz_to_mel(fmin)) * i / (n_mels + 1)\n            for i in range(n_mels + 2)]\n    hzs = [mel_to_hz(m) for m in mels]\n    bins = [int(h * n_fft / sr) for h in hzs]\n    fb = [[0.0] * (n_fft // 2 + 1) for _ in range(n_mels)]\n    for m in range(n_mels):\n        for k in range(bins[m], bins[m + 1]):\n            fb[m][k] = (k - bins[m]) / max(1, bins[m + 1] - bins[m])\n        for k in range(bins[m + 1], bins[m + 2]):\n            fb[m][k] = (bins[m + 2] - k) / max(1, bins[m + 2] - bins[m + 1])\n    return fb\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0058",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: mel filterbank"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: mel filterbank"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "fc59a1b59dcccb05e85eaa5b5bc730e84368f19d1c7743604aafc7ced85fc119",
      "target": "当 `n_fft=400` 时，覆盖 0–8 kHz 的 80 个 mel 频带会得到一个 `(80, 201)` 矩阵。将形状为 `(n_frames, 201)` 的 STFT 幅度矩阵与滤波器组矩阵的转置相乘，得到形状为 `(n_frames, 80)` 的 mel 频谱图。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0060",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: mel filterbank"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: log-mel"
      ],
      "ordinal": 31,
      "source_sha256": "f584e44eb501d8b8094c886d442e823eb9b2742dcb899c64a4b21a0a59e6582f",
      "target": "### 步骤 5：log-mel\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0062",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: log-mel"
      ],
      "ordinal": 31,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0063",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: log-mel"
      ],
      "ordinal": 32,
      "source_sha256": "bddb90c21a01c9f82efe83b2fdf48c2bca6fefcdf300ff758adec28add13fd0f",
      "target": "```python\ndef log_mel(mel_spec, eps=1e-10):\n    return [[math.log(max(v, eps)) for v in frame] for frame in mel_spec]\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0064",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: log-mel"
      ],
      "ordinal": 32,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: log-mel"
      ],
      "ordinal": 33,
      "source_sha256": "04e03d15005ff09c00e1ec15b3bd3935db0fe4370943095f337c29b37f62cb61",
      "target": "常见替代方法包括 `librosa.power_to_db`（按参考值归一化的 dB）和 `10 * log10(power + eps)`。Whisper 使用更复杂的裁剪 + 归一化流程（参见 Whisper 的 `log_mel_spectrogram`）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0066",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: log-mel"
      ],
      "ordinal": 33,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 6: MFCCs"
      ],
      "ordinal": 34,
      "source_sha256": "5f2db43e77f30df4f5a2d1d909e4209755f9510b91dac057215baf43935b0b23",
      "target": "### 步骤 6：MFCC\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0068",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 6: MFCCs"
      ],
      "ordinal": 34,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0069",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 6: MFCCs"
      ],
      "ordinal": 35,
      "source_sha256": "a2f91a2fc9d53a27acf7dd251259212f46f363dd87f66bce4d7434cb5fff3327",
      "target": "```python\ndef dct_ii(x, n_coeffs):\n    N = len(x)\n    return [\n        sum(x[n] * math.cos(math.pi * k * (2 * n + 1) / (2 * N)) for n in range(N))\n        for k in range(n_coeffs)\n    ]\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0070",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 6: MFCCs"
      ],
      "ordinal": 35,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 6: MFCCs"
      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
      "source_sha256": "e69471bcca7e58b9343f8a8a1a9bd71f328007634f5c6a35039f16731f902345",
      "target": "对每个 log-mel 帧应用 DCT，保留前 13 个系数，这就得到 MFCC 矩阵。通常会丢弃第一个系数，因为它编码了整体能量。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0072",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 6: MFCCs"
      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0073",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 37,
      "source_sha256": "5ea8444f1e52d79d0fa5a9889d9e68b6f9378788af91764ac90a2934dcc50b2b",
      "target": "## 实际使用\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0074",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 37,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 38,
      "source_sha256": "b5f6d498dc25c78d94f60b46a9aaaab318a7bb444048551be1450bf0d7abfac3",
      "target": "2026 年的技术栈：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0076",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 38,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0077",
      "kind": "table",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 39,
      "source_sha256": "ad8fb03d688de8614436a532d023499a88f337a3afbb297960bf508419fa184c",
      "target": "| 任务 | 特征 |\n|------|----------|\n| ASR（Whisper、Parakeet、SeamlessM4T） | 80 个 log-mel 频带，10 ms 帧移，25 ms 窗长 |\n| TTS 声学模型（VITS、F5-TTS、Kokoro） | 80 个 mel 频带，5–12 ms 帧移，用于精细的时间控制 |\n| 音频分类（AST、PANNs、BEATs） | 128 个 log-mel 频带，10 ms 帧移 |\n| 说话人嵌入（embedding）（ECAPA-TDNN、WavLM） | 80 个 log-mel 频带，或基于原始波形的自监督学习（SSL） |\n| 音乐（MusicGen、Stable Audio 2） | EnCodec 离散 token（词元），而非 mel 特征 |\n| 关键词检测 | 面向小型设备的 40 个 MFCC 系数 |\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0078",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 39,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 40,
      "source_sha256": "40e8ebf2ff8f1a6e7ad20b5adbb4de94b4d7755ac377a504ad2e3eed7c3f4d11",
      "target": "经验法则：**只要不是处理音乐，就从 80 个 log-mel 频带开始。** 采用其他选择需要充分理由。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0080",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 40,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0081",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Pitfalls that still ship in 2026"
      ],
      "ordinal": 41,
      "source_sha256": "d73b01854a80cb145d82ffe27e5e3bd7e209ae4038ae4fd2c3416445fd28041c",
      "target": "## 2026 年仍会带入生产环境的陷阱\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0082",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Pitfalls that still ship in 2026"
      ],
      "ordinal": 41,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0083",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Pitfalls that still ship in 2026"
      ],
      "ordinal": 42,
      "source_sha256": "a39d78b98b6837ec8657aa3eb312bc0d9fb7c92e7ce1ddb93de6667fafa02c23",
      "target": "- **mel 数量不匹配。** 训练时使用 80 个 mel 频带，推理时使用 128 个。故障可能悄无声息地发生。两端都应记录特征形状。\n- **上游采样率不匹配。** 以 22.05 kHz 计算的 mel 特征与以 16 kHz 计算的不同。应在特征化*之前*修正采样率（SR）。\n- **dB 与对数。** Whisper 需要 log-mel，而非 dB-mel。部分 HF 流水线会自动检测，你自己编写的代码则不会。\n- **归一化漂移。** 训练时对每条语音单独归一化，推理时却使用全局归一化。这种生产环境错误会让词错误率（WER）翻倍。\n- **填充导致的泄漏。** 在音频末尾补零，会使末尾帧产生平坦频谱。应使用对称填充或复制填充。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-02:b0084",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Spectrograms, Mel Scale & Audio Features",
        "## Pitfalls that still ship in 2026"
      ],
      "ordinal": 42,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
